  "_note": "Homebrew manifest for macOS. Host this at daneappmanifest-mac.json in the devmachine-app-manifest repo. Every cask/formula name here was validated against Homebrew. 'name' is set to the /Applications display name so installed-detection works for GUI apps; CLI formulae (git, node, gh, ...) have no .app and will show 'Not applied' — reinstalling them is harmless because brew exits 0 when already installed.",
